{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">國家主席習近平即將抵達美國華盛頓，展開三天訪問行程。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">相信是中美元首會談的地點白宮，戒備森嚴，有國民警衛隊在附近巡邏。附近有警車戒備，並拖走停在附近的車輛。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.US.XI.ARRIVAL-0430_001.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026xPJr4CiUFq1790198416.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.US.XI.ARRIVAL-0430_001.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">據報習近平專機在當地傍晚六時將抵達馬里蘭州安德魯斯聯合基地，美國總統特朗普會親自前往機場接機，並舉行歡迎儀式。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">翌日中美元首將於白宮舉行雙邊閉門會談，預料涵蓋經貿關稅、人工智能合作及區域安全等議題，晚上出席白宮國宴。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.US.XI.ARRIVAL-0430_003.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026gNTmkiqVGr1790198837.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.US.XI.ARRIVAL-0430_003.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-23T22:19:04.311478+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":187,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}